\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nAfter her breakup, Helena did not want to be reminded of her ex. While cleaning up her room, she found pieces of a letter in the trash and asked her mom about it. Her mom told her that the letter was from her ex, and she decided to tear it and throw it out.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Helena ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Anger\nB) Gratitude\nC) Disapproval\nD) Disgust\nE) Jealousy\nF) Anticipation\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Helena feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) Her mom showed her pieces of the old letter from her ex\nB) Her mom gave good advice on dealing with breakups\nC) Her mom threw out the letter from her ex to spare her feelings\nD) She was able to clean her room after the breakup","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.015906388213012365,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a74a9aa9dc5a833d9dcc","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484042691,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:47:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"37b0548f8600414d9c42c60f684afecc"}